ng started with ThePhotoStick Omni X is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni X to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni X is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our User Guide for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni X. We also offer live customer support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com</p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-851f5bfeb66d-22_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-851f5bfeb66d-23_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="383550b7-ee00-49ca-b4e4-848e3ab0a43d" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Which devices work with ThePhotoStick® Omni X?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="383550b7-ee00-49ca-b4e4-848e3ab0a43d" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-851f5bfeb66d-25_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-851f5bfeb66d-26_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-851f5bfeb66d-27_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-851f5bfeb66d-28_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">ThePhotoStick Omni X works with all modern computers, smartphones, and tablets right out of the box.<br><br>It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and Later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br>- Android: 8.0 and Later<br><br>For more up-to-date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our System Requirements page. </p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-851f5bfeb66d-30_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-851f5bfeb66d-31_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="6fecf031-a958-4d3c-b59a-c222449f4223" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick® Omni X?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="6fecf031-a958-4d3c-b59a-c222449f4223" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-851f5bfeb66d-33_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-851f5bfeb66d-34_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-851f5bfeb66d-35_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-851f5bfeb66d-36_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick Omni X:<br><br>32GB - 12,800 photos<br>64GB - 25,600 photos<br>128GB - 51,200 photos<br>256GB - 102,400 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni X, check out our Official User Guide.</em> </p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-851f5bfeb66d-46_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-851f5bfeb66d-47_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="3ce5e0bf-dc37-4de8-a7be-13401082dac1" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What photo and video file types can ThePhotoStick® Omni X detect?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="3ce5e0bf-dc37-4de8-a7be-13401082dac1" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-851f5bfeb66d-49_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-851f5bfeb66d-50_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-851f5bfeb66d-51_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-851f5bfeb66d-52_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Nearly all of them! It saves your standard JPEG, HEIC, PNG, GIF, MOV, and MP4, but ThePhotoStick Omni X can now protect your contacts, documents, and audio files. It saves a vast array of file types, as listed below:<br><br><strong>PHOTO EXTENSIONS:</strong><br>JPEG (*.jpg;*.jpeg;*.jpe;*.jfif)<br>HEIC (*.heic, *.heics, *.heif, *.heifs, *.avci, *.avcs)<br>GIF (*.gif)<br>PNG (*.png)BMP (*.bmp;*.rle;*.dib)<br>TIFF (*.tif,*.tiff)ICO (*.ico)<br>Camera Raw (*.crw, *.nef, *.raf, *.orf, *.mrw, *.dcr, *.mos, *.raw, *.pef, *.srf, *.dng, *.x3f, *.cr2, *.erf, *.sr2, *.kdc, *.mfw, *.mef, *.arw, *.nrw, *.rw2, *.rwl, *.iiq, *.3fr, *.srw) Photoshop (*.psd, *.pdd, *.pdp, *.pse, *.eps)<br>PICT File (*.PCT, *.PICT)<br><br><strong>VIDEO EXTENSIONS:</strong><br>MOV (*.mov, *.qt, *.hevc)<br>MPEG4 (*.mp4, *.mpeg4, *.m4v, *.h264)<br>AVI (*.avi)<br>WMV (*.wmv)<br><br><strong>OTHER EXTENSIONS:</strong> <br>Audio (*.mp3, *.wav)<br>Contacts (*.vcf) </p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-851f5bfeb66d-54_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-851f5bfeb66d-55_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="0695f3e6-10b7-4256-8956-c788060821f3" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Does ThePhotoStick® Omni X need to install anything on my computer?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="0695f3e6-10b7-4256-8956-c788060821f3" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-851f5bfeb66d-57_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-851f5bfeb66d-58_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-851f5bfeb66d-59_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-851f5bfeb66d-60_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3"><strong>For computers (Mac or PC):</strong> ThePhotoStick Omni X does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>It comes with everything it needs. Just simply plug it into an available USB slot, and you’re ready to get started.<br><br><strong>For phones (Android or iOS):</strong> ThePhotoStick Omni X offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.<br><br>There are no monthly charges or download costs for using the app – just download it and follow the on-screen instructions to easily get started. </p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapVNj kZpFRP pf-851f5bfeb66d-62_"><button type="button" class="sc-lnPyOc fMRkED pf-851f5bfeb66d-63_ pf-anchor" data-header-id="e718e115-a56c-460a-9585-5767911ef69b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I use ThePhotoStick® Omni X as an ongoing backup solution?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="e718e115-a56c-460a-9585-5767911ef69b" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-eulNPF hByIKx pf-851f5bfeb66d-65_"><div class="sc-bmzXxz iAfMPC pf-851f5bfeb66d-66_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px;position:relative" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fscnvs bOiGIg pf-851f5bfeb66d-67_"><p class="sc-doOhAX dfRERk pf-851f5bfeb66d-68_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people use ThePhotoStick Omni X&nbsp;for&nbsp;weekly backups to make sure they are continually protecting their memories. </p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-iapV